# Live Among The Natives with Free Colonists (FC) and Indentured Servants (IS) at Tupi villages.
# Fixture (start save): 7 colonists stand beside villages, each alone on its tile with full moves, no orders;
# the capital village (35,26) is set learned=true.
# RNG: Tupi alarm toward France (indians[7].alarm_by_player[1]) is 0 -> ai_relation_quartile 0, so the
# "band > 0" @LEARNSLOW roll never runs; the taught skill comes from the village-seeded stream (fixed per village).
# A village visit forfeits all the unit's moves; the game then selects the next unit by index (128, 129, 130, 133, 134).
# --- FC at unlearned village (46,26): "Not right now" -> @LEARNLATER, nothing changes
click 168 160   # select the FC at (45,26) west of the village
key KP_6        # step east onto the village -> village menu
key Return      # "Live Among The Natives" -> @LEARNSTAY (Cotton Planter)
key Down        # second row, "Not right now, thanks."
key Return      # -> @LEARNLATER
key Return      # dismiss it (FC stays unskilled, village not learned)
# --- IS (auto-selected, (46,25)) at the same village: accepts -> becomes Expert Cotton Planter
key KP_2        # south onto the village
key Return      # Live Among The Natives
key Return      # first row: "Then I shall become a master Cotton Planter"
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNDONE (IS profession 25 -> 3, village learned)
# --- FC at the capital (35,26), learned=true: a capital still teaches (no @LEARNALREADY)
key KP_4        # west onto the capital
key Return      # Live Among The Natives
key Return      # accept (Tobacco Planter)
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNDONE (FC profession 28 -> 2)
# --- IS at unlearned village (41,27): refuses -> @LEARNLATER
key KP_6        # east onto the village (IS at (40,27))
key Return      # Live Among The Natives
key Down        # "Not right now, thanks."
key Return
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNLATER (IS stays Indentured Servant)
# --- FC at the same village: accepts -> Expert Sugar Planter
key KP_2        # FC at (41,26): south onto the village
key Return
key Return      # accept
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNDONE (FC 28 -> 1, village learned)
# --- FC at a village that already taught (43,23): @LEARNALREADY, nothing learned
click 88 112    # select the FC at (43,24)
key KP_8        # north onto the village
key Return      # Live Among The Natives
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNALREADY
# --- IS at a village that already taught (46,22): @LEARNALREADY
click 120 80    # select the IS at (45,22)
key KP_6        # east onto the village
key Return      # Live Among The Natives
key Return      # dismiss @LEARNALREADY; the game selects the Dragoon in Quebec, map idle
